  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed waste and recycling storage and the fence, due to their siting and scale would adversely affect the the open character of the front area and character and appearance of the locally listed terrace building (127-141 Ewell Road) and Oak Hill Conservation Area (A). This would result in a low degree of harm to locally listed building, and less than substantial harm to the Oakhill Conservation Area (A). No public benefits have been identified that would outweigh the harm. Therefore, the proposal would be contrary to Policies HC1 of the London Plan 2021 and CS8, DM10 and DM12 of the RBK core Strategy 2012 and the NPPF 2024."
  ],
